urface":"கானல்","parts":[{"text":"கானல்","lemma":"கானல்","gloss":"seashore grove"}],"gloss":"seashore grove"},{"surface":"அல்கியும்","parts":[{"text":"அல்கி","lemma":"அல்கு","gloss":"stay"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and staying"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தொடலை","parts":[{"text":"தொடலை","lemma":"தொடலை","gloss":"garland"}],"gloss":"garland"},{"surface":"ஆயமொடு","parts":[{"text":"ஆயம்","lemma":"ஆயம்","gloss":"playmates"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the playmates"},{"surface":"தழுவு","parts":[{"text":"தழுவு","lemma":"தழுவு","gloss":"embrace"}],"gloss":"embrace"},{"surface":"அணி","parts":[{"text":"அணி","lemma":"அணி","gloss":"beauty"}],"gloss":"beauty"},{"surface":"அயர்ந்தும்","parts":[{"text":"அயர்ந்து","lemma":"அயர்","gloss":"perform"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and performing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நொதுமலர்","parts":[{"text":"நொதுமலர்","lemma":"நொதுமலர்","gloss":"strangers"}],"gloss":"strangers"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"கதுமென","parts":[{"text":"கதுமென","lemma":"கதுமென","gloss":"suddenly"}],"gloss":"suddenly"},{"surface":"வந்து","parts":[{"text":"வந்து","lemma":"வா","gloss":"come"}],"gloss":"having come"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"முயங்கினன்","parts":[{"text":"முயங்கினன்","lemma":"முயங்கு","gloss":"he embraced"}],"gloss":"he embraced"},{"surface":"செலினே","parts":[{"text":"செலின்","lemma":"செல்","gloss":"if he goes"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"if he goes"},{"surface":"அலர்ந்தன்று","parts":[{"text":"அலர்ந்தன்று","lemma":"அலர்","gloss":"gossip arose"}],"gloss":"gossip arose"},{"surface":"மன்னே","parts":[{"text":"மன்","lemma":"மன்","gloss":"indeed"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தித்தி","parts":[{"text":"தித்தி","lemma":"தித்தி","gloss":"beauty spots"}],"gloss":"beauty spots"},{"surface":"பரந்த","parts":[{"text":"பரந்த","lemma":"பர","gloss":"spread"}],"gloss":"spread"},{"surface":"பைத்து","parts":[{"text":"பைத்து","lemma":"பசுமை","gloss":"beautiful"}],"gloss":"beautiful"},{"surface":"அகல்","parts":[{"text":"அகல்","lemma":"அகல்","gloss":"wide"}],"gloss":"wide"},{"surface":"அல்குல்","parts":[{"text":"அல்குல்","lemma":"அல்குல்","gloss":"waist"}],"gloss":"waist"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"திருந்திழை","parts":[{"text":"திருந்திழை","lemma":"திருந்திழை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"துயல்வுக்கோட்","parts":[{"text":"துயல்வுக்கோட்","lemma":"துயல்வுக்கோட்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"டசைத்த","parts":[{"text":"டசைத்த","lemma":"டசைத்த","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பசுங்குழைத்","parts":[{"text":"பசுங்குழைத்","lemma":"பசுங்குழைத்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"தழையினும்","parts":[{"text":"தழையினும்","lemma":"தழையினும்","gloss":"even than the leaf-garment"}],"gloss":"even than the leaf-garment","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உழையின்","parts":[{"text":"உழையின்","lemma":"உழை","gloss":"from the side"}],"gloss":"from the side"},{"surface":"போகான்","parts":[{"text":"போகான்","lemma":"போ","gloss":"he does not go away"}],"gloss":"he does not go away"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தான்","parts":[{"text":"தான்","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"he himself"}],"gloss":"he himself"},{"surface":"தந்தனன்","parts":[{"text":"தந்தனன்","lemma":"தா","gloss":"gave"}],"gloss":"he gave"},{"surface":"யாய்","parts":[{"text":"யாய்","lemma":"யாய்","gloss":"mother"}],"gloss":"mother"},{"surface":"காத்து","parts":[{"text":"காத்து","lemma":"கா","gloss":"guarding"}],"gloss":"guarding"},{"surface":"ஓம்பல்","parts":[{"text":"ஓம்பல்","lemma":"ஓம்பு","gloss":"protecting"}],"gloss":"protecting"},{"surface":"ஏ","parts":[{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]}],"literal":"With the sea playing and in the seashore grove staying / with the garlanded playmates the beauty of embrace performing / like strangers suddenly having come / he embraced, if he goes, gossip arose indeed / beauty spots spread beautiful wide waist / perfect jewels swaying branch tied green sprout / even than the leaf-garment from her side he does not go away / he himself gave, mother guarding and protecting.","translation":"We played in the sea and stayed in the seashore grove, celebrating the joy of embraces with our garlanded playmates. If he had come suddenly like a stranger, embraced her, and then departed, gossip would have surely arisen. But now, he does not stir from her side, closer than the garment of fresh green leaves tied to the swaying branches that drapes her beautiful wide waist adorned with perfect jewels and beauty spots. He has given her back to us himself, and mother now guards her with care.","modern":"கடலில் விளையாடியும் கடற்கரைச் சோலையில் தங்கியும், மாலை அணிந்த தோழியருடன் தழுவி விளையாடி மகிழ்ந்தோம். அயலாரைப் போல அவன் திடீரென்று வந்து அவளைத் தழுவிவிட்டுச் சென்றிருந்தால், ஊரில் அலர் (பழிச்சொல்) தூற்றியிருக்கும். ஆனால், அழகிய தேமல் பரவிய, அகன்ற அல்குலில், திருத்தமான அணிகலன்களோடு, அசையும் மரக்கிளையிலிருந்து பறித்துக் கட்டிய பசிய தழையாடையை விடவும் அவளை விட்டு நீங்காமல் அவளருகிலேயே அவன் இருக்கிறான். அவனே அவளை எங்களிடம் ஒப்படைத்துவிட்டான்; இப்போது தாயும் அவளைப் பாதுகாத்துக் காக்கிறாள்.","explanation":"The confidante speaks to the hero, expressing relief that public gossip has been averted. She recalls how they used to play in the sea and seashore groves with their companions. If the hero had behaved like a fleeting stranger, embracing the heroine and leaving, rumors would have ruined her reputation. However, he has proven his commitment by staying constantly by her side, closer than the very leaf-garment she wears. Since he has formally returned her to her family's care, the mother now guards her safely at home, paving the way for an honorable marriage.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}